folio\",\"description\":\"MIQ LLC portfolio categories including Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia notability assessment, SEO, AEO, GEO, website development, branding, and digital marketing. Demonstration items are clearly labeled when applicable.\",\"url\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/portfolio\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"item\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/portfolio\"}]}</script><section class=\"hero-grid text-white\"><div class=\"grid-lines\"><div class=\"container-tight py-20 md:py-24\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\"><span class=\"text-sky-300\">Portfolio</span></p><h1 class=\"font-display max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold md:text-5xl\">Work categories and representative project examples</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-white/78\">Verified client work can be added as it is supplied. Demonstration projects and process examples are clearly labeled and do not represent fabricated testimonials, client logos, or performance statistics.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad \"><div class=\"container-tight \"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal\">Wikipedia Consulting</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal\">Website Development</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal\">SEO, AEO &amp; GEO</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal\">Branding</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal\">Digital Marketing</span></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric\">Website Development</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Corporate Service Website Concept</h2><p class=\"mt-2 inline-flex rounded-full bg-gold/12 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-charcoal\">Demonstration project</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">A premium, conversion-focused website structure designed for a professional services brand, emphasizing trust, clarity, and mobile responsiveness.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric\">SEO, AEO &amp; GEO</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Search &amp; Answer Visibility Planning Framework</h2><p class=\"mt-2 inline-flex rounded-full bg-gold/12 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-charcoal\">Demonstration project</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">An example planning workflow covering technical review, keyword/entity intent mapping, direct-answer content opportunities, structured data guidance, and measurement priorities.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric\">Branding</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Brand Identity System Concept</h2><p class=\"mt-2 inline-flex rounded-full bg-gold/12 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-charcoal\">Demonstration project</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">A sample identity direction with logo usage, typography, color strategy, and marketing asset consistency for a B2B service company.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric\">Wikipedia Consulting</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Wikipedia Notability &amp; Source Review Process</h2><p class=\"mt-2 inline-flex rounded-full bg-gold/12 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-charcoal\">Service process example</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">An illustrative Wikipedia consulting workflow for evaluating independent reliable sources, notability guidelines, neutral drafting considerations, conflict-of-interest disclosure, and editorial policy risks. No publication outcomes are implied.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric\">Digital Marketing</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Multi-Channel Growth Roadmap</h2><p class=\"mt-2 inline-flex rounded-full bg-gold/12 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-charcoal\">Demonstration project</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">A sample campaign planning structure aligning content, search, and social touchpoints with lead generation goals.</p></article></div><div class=\"mt-10 rounded-3xl bg-navy p-8 text-white\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold\">Have a project in mind?</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-white/72\">Contact MIQ LLC for a consultation and a service recommendation tailored to your goals.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy\" href=\"/contact\">Start a Conversation</a></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--><!--/&--><!--/&--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-navy text-white\"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64